  "body_html": "<h1>IsCompletelyMixed.actionProb_pos</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem IsCompletelyMixed.actionProb_pos {G : ExtensiveGame iota U} [(s : G.State) -&gt; Fintype (G.Action s)] {beta : G.BehaviorProfile} (hbeta : IsCompletelyMixed beta) {s : G.State} {i : iota} (hm : G.mover s = some i) (a : G.Action s) : 0 &lt; beta.actionProb s a</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>BehaviorProfile</li>\n<li>IsCompletelyMixed</li>\n<li>actionProb</li>\n</ul>",
